flowchart TD
  A[Resource request] --> N{Request <= Need?}
  N -->|no| ERR[ERROR_EXCEEDS_MAX]
  N -->|yes| V{Request <= Available?}
  V -->|no| W[WAIT_UNAVAILABLE]
  V -->|yes| TMP[Tentatively allocate]
  TMP --> SAFE{Safety algorithm succeeds?}
  SAFE -->|yes| G[Commit: GRANTED]
  SAFE -->|no| RB[Roll back]
  RB --> U[WAIT_UNSAFE]
